  "title": "Chocolate Ganache",
  "description": "This silky chocolate ganache made with just chocolate and cream is perfect for glazing cakes, filling pastries, topping brownies, and much more!",
  "authors": [
    "INGRIDEVOGEL"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:44:07-04:00",
